### Rayway — tests manuels POST /api/decks
### Extension recommandee : "REST Client" (VS Code) ou HTTP client JetBrains.
### Sinon : copie/colle chaque body dans Postman (les bodies sont aussi dans ./decks/*.json).
### La session est un COOKIE : lance d'abord le sign-in, le client renvoie le cookie tout seul.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@email = tester@rayway.dev
@password = password1234

### 0a. (une seule fois) creer le compte de test
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "name": "Tester" }

### 0b. se connecter (pose le cookie de session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 1. VALIDE -> 201 Created (renvoie le DeckDetailDto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/decks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Green/Purple Luffy — happy path",
  "isPublic": false,
  "leader": { "variantCode": "EB02-010_p2", "languageCode": "en" },
  "cards": [
    { "variantCode": "EB01-012_p3", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "EB01-013", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "EB01-014_p1", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "EB01-015_p1", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "EB01-016", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "EB01-017", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "EB01-018_p1", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 }
  ]
}

### 2. LEADER PAS UN LEADER -> 400 "Leader card must be a leader"
POST {{baseUrl}}/decks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leader invalide",
  "leader": { "variantCode": "EB01-014_p1", "languageCode": "en" },
  "cards": [ { "variantCode": "EB01-013", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 } ]
}

### 3. HORS-COULEUR -> 400 (regle couleur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/decks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carte Red hors deck Green/Purple",
  "leader": { "variantCode": "EB02-010_p2", "languageCode": "en" },
  "cards": [
    { "variantCode": "EB01-013", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "EB01-003_p2", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 4. >4 D'UNE MEME CARTE (2 variantes, meme Card.code) -> 400 (regle <=4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/decks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ">4 exemplaires",
  "leader": { "variantCode": "EB02-010_p2", "languageCode": "en" },
  "cards": [
    { "variantCode": "OP05-119", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 4 },
    { "variantCode": "OP05-119_p1", "languageCode": "en", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

